WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.453
Bird heard something.

2
00:00:14.454 --> 00:00:19.861
It was coming from Kip's hole.

3
00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:22.998
Chop, chop, chop!

4
00:00:22.999 --> 00:00:25.475
Shloop . . . Scrape, scrape!

5
00:00:25.476 --> 00:00:28.616
"What are you doing, Kip?" asked Bird.

6
00:00:28.617 --> 00:00:32.408
"I'm making acorn gumbo," said Kip.

7
00:00:32.409 --> 00:00:35.102
Then Bird smelled something.

8
00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:41.855
It was something that smelled very bad.

9
00:00:41.856 --> 00:00:45.608
"You are going to eat that?" asked Bird.

10
00:00:45.609 --> 00:00:48.641
"No," said Kip.

11
00:00:48.642 --> 00:00:51.118
"We are going to eat it.

12
00:00:51.119 --> 00:01:03.927
You are invited to dinner tonight!"

13
00:01:03.928 --> 00:01:08.253
"Kip, this doesn't smell good," said Bird.

14
00:01:08.254 --> 00:01:11.769
"It doesn't smell good," said Kip.

15
00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:16.865
"But it tastes great."

16
00:01:16.866 --> 00:01:19.616
Just then Bird saw something.

17
00:01:19.617 --> 00:01:30.073
"There's the hawk!" she cried.

18
00:01:30.074 --> 00:01:38.755
The big hawk was swooping toward the tree!

19
00:01:38.756 --> 00:01:43.537
"Yuck! Something smells bad!" said the hawk.

20
00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:50.098
The hawk turned around and flew away.

21
00:01:50.099 --> 00:02:05.879
"Whew," said Kip.

22
00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:11.158
"Your acorn gumbo saved us, Kip!" said Bird.

23
00:02:11.159 --> 00:02:15.812
"And you're right. It does taste great!"
